.TH WENCESLAS 1
.SH NAME
wenceslas \- snow rescue game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/wenceslas
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Wenceslas
is a snow rescue game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Walk through the snow, leave footprints, and burn trees with space so peasants stay warm.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B arrows / wasd
Move king
.TP
.B space
Burn trees (warmth)
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/wenceslas.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
